          "filename": "20160127 Sri Lanka 4078+0-3 Sinharaja Forest Reserve sRGB (25143004933).jpg",
          "caption": "Dinner starts with seafood cocktail with coleslaw Hawaii and cocktail sauce.  The soup is cream of mushroom with croutons.  For my main course I choose the Chicken Platter served with grilled vegetables, vegetable rice, and potato wedges accompanied by a barbecue and black pepper sauce.  Dessert is a fruit compote and a raspberry mousse cake.\nOn Google Earth:\n\nThe Rainforest Ecolodge  6°23'21.85\"N, 80°35'47.62\"",
